msgid ""
"The ``NO_PROXY`` variable can include: - IP addresses (e.g., ``1.2.3.4``)"
" - CIDR ranges (e.g., ``1.2.3.4/8``) - Domain names (e.g., "
"``example.com``) - Subdomains (e.g., ``.example.com``)"
